### Crear un registro de Parking History
POST http://localhost:3000/api/parking-history
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placa": "ABC123",
  "check_in": "2024-11-28T08:00:00Z",
  "check_out": "2024-11-28T12:00:00Z",
  "licensePlate": "ABC123",
  "cost": 10.50,
  "observaciones": "Vehículo parqueado en zona A"
}

### Crear otro registro
POST http://localhost:3000/api/parking-history
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placa": "XYZ789",
  "check_in": "2024-11-28T09:00:00Z",
  "check_out": "2024-11-28T18:00:00Z",
  "licensePlate": "XYZ789",
